<title>UK: Crown Products warns of losses in '97 H1.</title>
<headline>Crown Products warns of losses in '97 H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British giftware and creative play goods company Crown Products Group Plc warned on Tuesday it expected to suffer &quot;greater than expected&quot; losses in its first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the losses would mainly occur due to poor trading in its domestic gift company Hunkdory Designs Ltd.</p>
